      "label": "Agent",
      "scopeNote": "Four measured passes into R_Judge — inventory, accessibility, branding, locales — each one required to MEASURE rather than assert, because an automated pass alone missed three defects a rendered look caught outright. If GW_Findings comes back yes, this lane still does not fix anything: A_RaiseFindings sends the finding back to whoever authored the theme choice, since picking it was a judgement call this lane does not get to override.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/ui/theme-ui-review.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-who-iris-site-i18n/cat-harness.jsonld#role/librarian",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "prefLabel": "Librarian",
      "title": "Librarian",
      "notation": "librarian",
      "definition": "Acquires a source and files it. Distinct from `ingestion-agent`, which DERIVES structure from a source already in hand: this role decides what to capture, how faithfully, and what must be recorded at the moment of capture because nobody can reconstruct it later.",
      "inScheme": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-who-iris-site-i18n/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld"
    },
    {
