      "label": "Build pipeline",
      "scopeNote": "Runs the checks that decide the gateways: the tools' import closure and the content's lack of code, node identifiers against file paths, the standalone rehearsal, and dereferencing after release. A gate that cannot tell stops the process; it never reads as clean.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/kg-separation.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-who-iris-site-i18n/cat-harness.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_KgToPortal/Lane_Pipeline",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#LaneUsage",
