      "label": "Verification",
      "scopeNote": "Asks the question the whole process exists to keep answerable: does the SOURCE still hash to its recorded digest? A copy-out that disturbed the original is not a copy-out, and this lane is the only thing that can tell the difference after the fact — the bytes look the same either way.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/library/copy-out-materialized.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-who-iris-site-i18n/cat-harness.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_QaReportSigning/Lane_Qa",
